        "answer": {
          "short": "A suitable graph is shown.",
          "worked": "Use equal-width bars and a number scale from 0 to 25, marked in steps of 5. Include a title and label both axes. The bar lengths are 6, 3, 25, 2, 4, 4 and 6 animals, respectively.",
          "solutionDiagrams": [
            {
              "id": "p12-q4-a-solution-graph",
              "role": "solution",
              "format": "tikz",
              "code": "% mathsmap-diagram-colours {\"version\":1,\"kind\":\"graph\",\"base\":[],\"semantic\":[],\"reference\":\"teacher PDF page 60, Exercise 19C question 4(a)\"}\n\\begin{tikzpicture}[x=0.28cm,y=0.65cm]\n\\special{dvisvgm:raw <metadata data-graph-strokes=\"1\"/>}\n\\foreach \\x in {0,5,...,25} {\\draw[black,line width=0.25pt] (\\x,0.5)--(\\x,7.5);}\n\\draw[black,line width=0.5pt] (0,7.5)--(0,0.5)--(25,0.5);\n\\foreach \\x in {0,5,...,25} {\\draw[black,line width=0.4pt] (\\x,0.5)--(\\x,0.35);\\node[below,font=\\fontsize{8.5}{10}\\selectfont] at (\\x,0.3) {\\special{dvisvgm:raw <g data-graph-text=\"tick\">}\\x\\special{dvisvgm:raw </g>}};}\n\\foreach \\y/\\v/\\name in {7/6/Chicken,6/3/Pig,5/25/Sheep,4/2/Horse,3/4/Goose,2/4/Dog,1/6/Cow} {\\draw[black,fill=white,line width=0.8pt] (0,\\y-0.3) rectangle (\\v,\\y+0.3);\\node[left,font=\\fontsize{10}{12}\\selectfont] at (0,\\y) {\\name};}\n\\node[font=\\fontsize{10}{12}\\selectfont] at (12.5,-2.1) {Number of animals};\n\\node[rotate=90,font=\\fontsize{10}{12}\\selectfont] at (-15,4) {Type of animal};\n\\node[above,font=\\fontsize{10}{12}\\selectfont,align=center] at (12.5,8.2) {Hobby farm\\\\animal numbers};\n\\end{tikzpicture}",
